  <result aggregation-status="0" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adolescents and Youth have equitable access to learning opportunities, economic empowerment, skills building and meaningfulparticipation</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2016, UNICEF Lebanon engaged in several systems strengthening activities. UNICEF Lebanon, together with partners, reached adolescents and youth in a number of ways including through life-skills and conflict resolution training; employability and agriculture training courses; and entrepreneurship, employability and competency-based trainings. | Status:On-track | As-of Date:12/01/2017</narrative>
   </description>
   <indicator ascending="0">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">of girls, boys enrolled in V-technical and agriculture schools</narrative>
